{"4331030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Megabonk Apocalypse", "steam_appid": 4331030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4630540, 4630590, 4630640, 4630670, 4630700, 4630790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will battle against enemy vehicles and buildings of similar size across a vast, desolate wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a different objective; eliminate the designated objective to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Weapons can be obtained by collecting chests; weapon types are randomized, sometimes rifles, sometimes shotguns, sometimes rocket launchers, etc. Levels contain numerous supply crates that can be used to pick up special weapons and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Vehicles are available in levels; the number of items in the environment far exceeds the player's, so the actual size of drivable vehicles is roughly the same as the player's vehicle. The game includes a wide variety of vehicles; players can drive planes and tanks, most of which are mobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. The game has thirty levels. Players can collect coins to purchase weapons and prepare for each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Experience thrilling and varied explosion effects, and feel the chaos of battle.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will battle against enemy vehicles and buildings of similar size across a vast, desolate wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a different objective; eliminate the designated objective to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Weapons can be obtained by collecting chests; weapon types are randomized, sometimes rifles, sometimes shotguns, sometimes rocket launchers, etc. Levels contain numerous supply crates that can be used to pick up special weapons and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >